cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the associated paper."
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous"
title: "Script Bias in Neural MT Evaluation Metrics for Indic Languages"
year: 2026
type: article
repository-code: "https://github.com/John-salvin/script-bias-comet-indic-mt"
abstract: >
  This paper investigates script bias in neural MT evaluation metrics (COMET, chrF, BERTScore)
  when applied to Indic languages, using the IndicMT-Eval MQM dataset. We introduce the
  Script Bias Index (SBI) and demonstrate that script form accounts for ~22.9% of metric
  score variance across 9 statistical tests.
keywords:
  - machine translation evaluation
  - script bias
  - Indic languages
  - COMET
  - romanization
  - NLP
license: MIT
